-- Willett import (bourbon.willett: kentuckybourbonwhiskey.com, the current home of willettdistillery.com), applied 2026-09-24 via the Supabase MCP.
-- Hand steps: the site hosts several of the family's brands under one domain; four seed rows had been filed under the Willett family with the wrong brand and are merged into the new correctly-filed rows: Johnny Drum Private Stock, Kentucky Vintage (seed name 'Vintage Bourbon'), Pure Kentucky (seed name 'Pure Kentucky XO'). A duplicate 'Old Bardstown Estate Bourbon' row was merged into 'Old Bardstown Estate Bottled' before the run.
-- Stale opt-in: a legacy 10-year 'Old Bardstown' from 2016 pricing data, Willett 2 Year Rye, Willett Exploratory Cask Finish, Willett Family Estate Bottled Rye, Willett Single Barrel — all limited/store-pick items the current lineup no longer carries.

